## Timing
To successfully complete the steps outlined in the protocol, researchers must have expertise in the following areas: basic organic synthesis, recombinant protein expression and protein purification, protein bioconjugation, biochemical analysis of proteins (e.g., UV-Vis, circular dichroism, polyacrylamide gel electrophoresis), and macromolecular structural biology (e.g., single-crystal XRD, TEM, cryogenic electron microscopy, SAXS).
